5242</a> Akt, including akt1 and akt2, interacts with and phosphorylates x-linked inhibitor of apoptosis protein (xiap) at residue serine-87 in vitro and in vivo. Phosphorylation of xiap by akt protects xiap from ubiquitination and degradation in response to cisplatin."],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":6,"n":"EdgeBetweenness","v":"82.0","d":"double"}, {"po":6,"n":"notes","v":[""],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":6,"n":"cell_data","v":[""],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":6,"n":"citation","v":["pubmed:14645242"],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":6,"n":"tissue_data","v":["BTO:0001023"],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":6,"n":"direct","v":"true","d":"boolean"}, {"po":6,"n":"annotator","v":["lperfetto"],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":6,"n":"residue","v":["Ser87"],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":6,"n":"sequence","v":["VGRHRKVsPNCRFIN"],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":6,"n":"name","v":"AKT1 (up-regulates quantity by stabilization) XIAP"}, {"po":6,"n":"mechanism","v":["phosphorylation"],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":44,"n":"sentence","v":["<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://identifiers.org/pubmed/19576176\">pubmed:19576176</a> Here we show that full-length Lrrk2 or fragments containing its kinase domain have a significant capacity to phosphorylate recombinant alpha synuclein (Asyn) at serine 129. Such phosphorylated Asyn is the major component of pathological deposits in PD."],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":44,"n":"EdgeBetweenness","v":"48.0","d":"double"}, {"po":44,"n":"notes","v":[""],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":44,"n":"cell_data","v":[""],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":44,"n":"citation","v":["pubmed:19576176"],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":44,"n":"tissue_data","v":[""],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":44,"n":"direct","v":"true","d":"boolean"}, {"po":44,"n":"annotator","v":["lperfetto"],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":44,"n":"residue","v":["Ser129"],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":44,"n":"sequence","v":["NEAYEMPsEEGYQDY"],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":44,"n":"name","v":"LRRK2 (down-regulates activity) SNCA"}, {"po":44,"n":"mechanism","v":["phosphorylation"],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":35,"n":"sentence","v":["<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://identifiers.org/pubmed/19824698\">pubmed:19824698</a> We identified ser1403, thr1404, thr1410, thr1491 located within the roc domain, as well as thr1967 and thr1969 in the kinase domain, as the autophosphorylation sites. substitution of thr1969 located in close proximity to thr1967 had little effect on its kinase activity","<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://identifiers.org/pubmed/19824698\">pubmed:19824698</a>  We identified ser1403, thr1404, thr1410, thr1491 located within the roc domain, as well as thr1967 and thr1969 in the kinase domain, as the autophosphorylation sites. Substitution of thr1967, an autophosphorylation site located within the kinase domain, to ala caused a significant decrease in the kinase activity","<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://identifiers.org/pubmed/20595391\">pubmed:20595391</a>  Three putative autophosphorylation sites (thr-2031, ser-2032, and thr-2035) have been identified within the activation segment of the lrrk2 kinase domain based on sequence homology to mixed-lineage kinases. Phosphorylation at one or more of these sites is critical for the kinase activity of lrrk2."],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":35,"n":"EdgeBetweenness","v":"0.0","d":"double"}, {"po":35,"n":"notes","v":[""],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":35,"n":"cell_data","v":["BTO:0000938"],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":35,"n":"citation","v":["pubmed:19824698","pubmed:20595391"],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":35,"n":"tissue_data","v":[""],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":35,"n":"direct","v":"true","d":"boolean"}, {"po":35,"n":"annotator","v":["lperfetto"],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":35,"n":"residue","v":["Thr2031","Thr1969","Ser2032","Thr1967","Thr2035"],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":35,"n":"sequence","v":["DKASLTRtLQHRIAL","CCRMGIKtSEGTPGF","GIKTSEGtPGFRAPE","QQDKASLtRTLQHRI","CRMGIKTsEGTPGFR"],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":35,"n":"name","v":"LRRK2 (up-regulates) LRRK2"}, {"po":35,"n":"mechanism","v":["phosphorylation"],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":11,"n":"sentence","v":["<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://identifiers.org/pubmed/19824698\">pubmed:19824698</a> We identified ser1403, thr1404, thr1410, thr1491 located within the roc domain, as well as thr1967 and thr1969 in the kinase domain, as the autophosphorylation sites.","<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://identifiers.org/pubmed/19824698\">pubmed:19824698</a>  We identified ser1403, thr1404, thr1410, thr1491 located within the roc domain, as well as thr1967 and thr1969 in the kinase domain, as the autophosphorylation sites."],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":11,"n":"EdgeBetweenness","v":"0.0","d":"double"}, {"po":11,"n":"notes","v":[""],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":11,"n":"cell_data","v":["BTO:0000938"],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":11,"n":"citation","v":["pubmed:19824698"],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":11,"n":"tissue_data","v":[""],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":11,"n":"direct","v":"true","d":"boolean"}, {"po":11,"n":"annotator","v":["lperfetto"],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":11,"n":"residue","v":["Thr1404","Thr1410","Ser1403"],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":11,"n":"sequence","v":["AGREEFYsTHPHFMT","STHPHFMtQRALYLA","GREEFYStHPHFMTQ"],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":11,"n":"name","v":"LRRK2 (unknown) LRRK2"}, {"po":11,"n":"mechanism","v":["phosphorylation"],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":1,"n":"sentence","v":["<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://identifiers.org/pubmed/19824698\">pubmed:19824698</a> We identified ser1403, thr1404, thr1410, thr1491 located within the roc domain, as well as thr1967 and thr1969 in the kinase domain, as the autophosphorylation sites. eduction in the gtp-bound form of lrrk2 caused by t1491d mutation might have lowered the kinase activity, implicating the autophosphorylation of the roc domain in a negative feedback regulation of the kinase activity of lrrk2."],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":1,"n":"EdgeBetweenness","v":"0.0","d":"double"}, {"po":1,"n":"notes","v":[""],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":1,"n":"cell_data","v":["BTO:0000938"],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":1,"n":"citation","v":["pubmed:19824698"],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":1,"n":"tissue_data","v":[""],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":1,"n":"direct","v":"true","d":"boolean"}, {"po":1,"n":"annotator","v":["lperfetto"],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":1,"n":"residue","v":["Thr1491"],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":1,"n":"sequence","v":["DYHFVNAtEESDALA"],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":1,"n":"name","v":"LRRK2 (down-regulates) LRRK2"}, {"po":1,"n":"mechanism","v":["phosphorylation"],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":0,"n":"sentence","v":["<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://identifiers.org/pubmed/21658387\">pubmed:21658387</a>  A knockdown experiment using intact cells also demonstrated LRRK2-mediated phosphorylation of Akt1 (Ser473), suggesting that Akt1 is a convincing candidate for the physiological substrate of LRRK2.","<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://identifiers.org/pubmed/24916379\">pubmed:24916379</a> Expression of wild-type LRRK2 promoted neuronal survival against apoptosis through activation of the downstream effector, Akt by phosphorylation of Ser473. Phosphorylated Akt in turn inhibited FOXO 1 signaling"],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":0,"n":"EdgeBetweenness","v":"72.0","d":"double"}, {"po":0,"n":"notes","v":[""],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":0,"n":"cell_data","v":["BTO:0000938"],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":0,"n":"citation","v":["pubmed:21658387","pubmed:24916379"],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":0,"n":"tissue_data","v":[""],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":0,"n":"direct","v":"true","d":"boolean"}, {"po":0,"n":"annotator","v":["lperfetto"],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":0,"n":"residue","v":["Ser473"],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":0,"n":"sequence","v":["RPHFPQFsYSASGTA"],"d":"list_of_string"}, {"po":0,"n":"name","v":"LRRK2 (up-regulates) AKT1"}, {"po":0,"n":"mechanism","v":["phosphorylation"],"d":"list_of_string"}]},
